WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.800
Narrator: Saudi Civil Defense can warn people in several ways.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:12.100
Narrator: An alert can arrive on every phone in an area, through the National Early Warning Platform, with a loud and different tone.

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:14.300
Narrator: Public sirens may sound.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:17.800
Narrator: And Civil Defense publish instructions on their official channels.

00:00:19.542 --> 00:00:23.642
Narrator: Civil Defense test these systems, and tests are announced in advance.

00:00:23.842 --> 00:00:26.042
Narrator: A test is not an emergency.

00:00:26.242 --> 00:00:31.042
Narrator: An alert can warn of different dangers, including a missile or air-raid threat.

00:00:31.242 --> 00:00:35.642
Narrator: At the stadium, wait for the instruction from the venue control room.
